    description: "Stay in the loop for what’s happening at The Best Event! Join our Telegram group for all the updates 👉 https://t.me/+5KzXYg2cridmOGRl For sponsor inquiries, please contact Mihir via email or Telegram . Follow The Best Event on Instagram for event information, recaps, features, and giveaways 👉 https://instagram.com/thebestevent The Best Event: AFTER DARK The Best Event Afterdark is a global-level production where Web3 meets world-class entertainment. If you're tired of the same old venues, the same boring formats, hours of pointless speeches, and stiff networking, The Best Event Afterdark is where you need to be. We've made the news for our events before, and we're likely to do it again. Come make history, make great connections, and have an amazing night while you're doing it. 7:00 PM – 9:00 PM: VIP Networking (VIP Ticket-Holders Only) 9:00PM - 1:30AM: The Main Event (All Ticket Holders, FCFS for GA) AFTERDARK Highlights: 👥 1,000+ attendees 🌍 Global PR & media reach 🎵 Artists to be announced soon! Held at Bağlami , one of BKC's most sought-after lifestyle destinations, in the heart of Mumbai's most premium district. Known for its striking design, world-class cocktail programme and music-driven energy, Bağlami seamlessly transforms from an elevated dining space into a high-octane nightlife venue, making it the perfect home for AFTERDARK. Expect refined interiors, an electric crowd, and a night Mumbai won't forget. ​​Hosted by: The Best Event is the global series where Web3 comes to life — blending culture, tech, music, and community in iconic venues around the world. We bring together the boldest creators, top brands, and visionaries shaping the future for unforgettable, high-energy experiences. TBV (TB Ventures) is a VC fund focused on leading rounds in early-stage web3 companies in Southeast Asia and North America. TBV is supported by TBE (TB Events) and TBA (TB Advisory), creating a network of services that are underpinned by a 100k+ social following and 10k+ active TG community. ​​Supported by: Golden Ratio Group is a European-focused, MiCA-aligned ecosystem bridging traditional finance and digital assets through instant trading, borderless payments, and tokenized real-world assets. Brickken is an institutional-grade software provider delivering end-to-end infrastructure for the compliant tokenization and management of real-world assets (RWA). Zoth is the privacy-first stablecoin neobank for the Global South and the agentic economy. Move it, hold it, grow it : cross-border payments through zPayments, a stablecoin account, and institutional yield through zVaults, now with AI agents that execute while you approve.",
